  114    publisher    = &#123;Zenodo&#125;,

  126        <p>
  127:         Chemistrycal is an open educational and laboratory utility. If you identify a formula edge case, require a specific reagent addition to our database, or wish to propose an analytical workflow collaboration, please reach out directly through our <a href="/contact" style="color: #0284c7; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none;">Contact Page</a>.
  128        </p>

